{"kind":"article","seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Related Documentation","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/ServiceReference","doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/EntitlementMapping","doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToImplementService"],"anchor":"Related-Documentation"},{"title":"How-to Guides","generated":true,"anchor":"How-to-Guides","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToImplementService","doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToPresentTheUI","doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToPreviewAndTest"]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/howtoaddapermanentlicense"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Many apps offer two ways to buy: a recurring pro subscription and a one-time lifetime purchase. RevenueCat models both as entitlements; "},{"code":"RevenueCatPaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" checks each independently and surfaces them as the two flags on "},{"code":"EntitlementSnapshot","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"isPro","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — active subscription."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"hasPermanentLicense","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — active lifetime entitlement."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The paywall plugin’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isGateSatisfied"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isPro || hasPermanentLicense"},{"type":"text","text":", so feature code keeps a single check while UI can branch on the underlying flags when it needs to."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For the entitlement-mapping rules and edge cases, see "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/EntitlementMapping","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Before-you-start","type":"heading","text":"Before you start"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This guide assumes:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You have completed ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToImplementService","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You have configured ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"two","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" entitlements in the RevenueCat dashboard — typically ","type":"text"},{"code":"pro","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for the subscription and ","type":"text"},{"code":"lifetime","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for the one-time purchase. The identifiers are arbitrary; only the strings need to match what you pass into the service.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"heading","text":"Step 1: Pass the second identifier","level":2,"anchor":"Step-1-Pass-the-second-identifier"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Replace the single-entitlement init with the two-arg form:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","","let service = RevenueCatPaywallService(","    entitlementID: \"pro\",","    permanentLicenseEntitlementID: \"lifetime\"",")"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Both entitlements are now checked on every "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"customerInfo()"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"customerInfoStream()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" yield, and ","type":"text"},{"code":"restorePurchases()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" call. The active state of ","type":"text"},{"code":"pro","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" flows into ","type":"text"},{"code":"EntitlementSnapshot.isPro","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"; the active state of ","type":"text"},{"code":"lifetime","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" flows into "},{"code":"hasPermanentLicense","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The two flags are independent. A user with both active gets both flags set; a user with only one active gets only that flag set."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Step 2: Wire the service into the plugin","level":2,"anchor":"Step-2-Wire-the-service-into-the-plugin"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Same as the single-entitlement case — the plugin doesn’t need to know about the second identifier:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["plugins.register(","    PaywallPlugin<AppState, AppAction>(","        state: \\.paywall,","        action: AppAction.paywall,","        extractAction: { if case .paywall(let a) = $0 { return a }; return nil },","        service: RevenueCatPaywallService(","            entitlementID: \"pro\",","            permanentLicenseEntitlementID: \"lifetime\"","        )","    )",")"]},{"type":"heading","text":"Step 3: Decide whether feature code needs to branch","level":2,"anchor":"Step-3-Decide-whether-feature-code-needs-to-branch"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For most gated features, keep using "},{"code":"store.paywall.isGateSatisfied","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["if store.paywall.isGateSatisfied { … }"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This stays correct whether the user has a subscription or a lifetime license, and works identically in apps that don’t sell a lifetime SKU."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Step 4: Branch in UI when copy must differ","level":2,"anchor":"Step-4-Branch-in-UI-when-copy-must-differ"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the paywall sheet should be hidden for lifetime customers (so they’re not pestered to subscribe), or if the customer-center entry should be relabeled, branch on the underlying flag:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["if store.paywall.hasPermanentLicense {","    Text(\"Lifetime member — thank you!\")","} else if store.paywall.isPro {","    Button(\"Manage Subscription\") {","        store.send(.paywall(.presentCustomerCenter))","    }","} else {","    Button(\"Upgrade\") {","        store.send(.paywall(.request(reason: \"upgrade-prompt\")))","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Lifetime users typically have nothing to manage in App Store \/ Settings. Hiding the customer-center button for them avoids dead-end taps."}]},{"anchor":"When-to-skip-the-second-identifier","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"When to skip the second identifier"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Pass ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (or omit the parameter) if your app has no lifetime SKU:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["RevenueCatPaywallService(entitlementID: \"pro\")"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"hasPermanentLicense","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" then stays ","type":"text"},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" regardless of any entitlements RevenueCat reports — even if the dashboard accidentally has a ","type":"text"},{"code":"lifetime","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" entitlement that the service is not configured to check. See the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Lifetime entitlement is ignored when no permanent-license ID is configured"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" test case for the precise behavior.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToAddAPermanentLicense"},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sell a lifetime entitlement alongside a subscription and surface both flags through the paywall plugin."}],"metadata":{"title":"How to Add a Permanent License","role":"article","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall"}],"roleHeading":"Article"},"references":{"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/HowToPresentTheUI":{"kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToPresentTheUI","abstract":[{"text":"Attach ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"revenueCatPaywallAndCustomerCenter"},{"text":" from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI"},{"text":" to a root view to present both surfaces from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PaywallState"},{"text":", or attach either binding-driven primitive by itself.","type":"text"}],"title":"How to Present the UI","role":"article","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/howtopresenttheui"},"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/HowToPreviewAndTest":{"kind":"article","type":"topic","title":"How to Preview and Test","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToPreviewAndTest","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Drive entitlement state from SwiftUI previews and tests with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MockRevenueCatPaywallService"},{"type":"text","text":" — no RevenueCat SDK call required."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/howtopreviewandtest","role":"article"},"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/ServiceReference":{"kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/ServiceReference","abstract":[{"text":"API reference for ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RevenueCatPaywallService"},{"text":" — the RevenueCat-backed ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PaywallService"},{"type":"text","text":" conformer that the paywall plugin consumes."}],"title":"Service Reference","role":"article","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/servicereference"},"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/HowToImplementService":{"kind":"article","type":"topic","title":"How to Implement the Service","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToImplementService","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Wire "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RevenueCatPaywallService"},{"type":"text","text":" into the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxPaywall"},{"type":"text","text":" plugin so the store sees real-time entitlement updates from RevenueCat."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/howtoimplementservice","role":"article"},"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/EntitlementMapping":{"title":"Entitlement Mapping","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/EntitlementMapping","type":"topic","kind":"article","role":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"How RevenueCat’s "},{"code":"CustomerInfo.entitlements","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" translates to Swidux’s "},{"code":"EntitlementSnapshot","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/entitlementmapping"},"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall":{"title":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"RevenueCat adapter for Swidux’s "},{"code":"PaywallPlugin","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Implements "},{"code":"PaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" against "},{"code":"Purchases.shared","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", ships a controllable mock for previews and tests, and pairs with "},{"code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for drop-in "},{"code":"PaywallView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"CustomerCenterView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" presentation."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall"}}}